//   - API keys (BibleGateway, Open-Meteo, Wordnik)
//   - Location coordinates (latitude, longitude)
//   - Any other sensitive configuration
//
// These values are stored in NVS (Non-Volatile Storage) at runtime.
// They are never logged to Serial or written to files.

